cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mtb-resistotyper-ml-pipeline: feature engineering and model training for M. tuberculosis drug-resistance prediction"
abstract: >-
  Nextflow pipeline that assembles the CRyPTIC compendium into a checksummed
  DuckDB database, builds per-drug feature marts under versioned feature
  engineering, selects features by causal concordance inside each
  held-out-lineage fold, and trains H2O AutoML models. It can also resume
  training from a deposited database, and build resistance catalogues with
  catomatic.
authors:
